<%- include('partials/head') %>
<%- include('partials/header') %>
<main>
  <section class="page-shell about-hero">
    <p class="eyebrow">About Kyoona</p>
    <h1 class="display-title">WE JUST WANTED TO KNOW WHERE <span class="accent-coral">EVERYONE WAS GOING.</span></h1>
    <p class="lede">Somehow, finding out what's happening can involve six WhatsApp groups, three flyers, somebody's status, and a cousin who swears they sent you the details. Kyoona Connect puts it all in one place: the events, the people, and the places that make a foreign city feel a little more like home.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="mission">
    <div class="shell">
      <p class="script-big light">Why it matters</p>
      <blockquote>"We are building a space where Ugandans in the diaspora can find laughter, support, friendship, love, opportunity, and belonging."</blockquote>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="shell">
      <h2 class="section-title">MORE THAN A <span class="accent-coral">CALENDAR.</span></h2>
      <div class="values">
        <div class="value v1"><span>🌍</span><h3>Connection without pressure</h3><p>Friendship, community, a business partner. Join at your own pace. No algorithms pushing you into boxes.</p></div>
        <div class="value v2"><span>🍌</span><h3>Culture that feels familiar</h3><p>Stories, Luganda phrases, food memories, traditions. Here your background is celebrated, not explained away.</p></div>
        <div class="value v3"><span>🤝🏾</span><h3>Community that adds to you</h3><p>Find the associations, churches and gatherings in your city, and show up as your whole self.</p></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section faq-section" id="faq">
    <div class="shell faq-grid">
      <div><p class="eyebrow">Good questions</p><h2 class="section-title">FAQ.</h2></div>
      <div class="faq">
        <details open><summary>What is Kyoona Connect?</summary><p>A home base for Ugandans in the diaspora: events worth going to, the community groups and churches in your city, and a way to hear about it all first. We're starting in Greater Boston.</p></details>
        <details><summary>What happens when I join the community?</summary><p>You confirm your email, tell us what you're into, and we email you when something's happening. That's it. Unsubscribe with one click whenever you want.</p></details>
        <details><summary>Will you share my email?</summary><p>No. Not with sponsors, not with organizers, not with your auntie's business. See our <a class="text-link" href="/privacy">privacy note</a>.</p></details>
        <details><summary>Is WhatsApp coming?</summary><p>Yes. Email first, WhatsApp updates next.</p></details>
        <details><summary>I'm organizing something. Can I list it?</summary><p>Yes, please. Send the details to <a class="text-link" href="mailto:<%= contact %>"><%= contact %></a> and we'll put it up.</p></details>
        <details><summary>I run an association, church or Ugandan business. Can I be listed?</summary><p>Free, always. <a class="text-link" href="mailto:<%= contact %>?subject=Add%20a%20listing">Send us your details</a> or correct an existing listing.</p></details>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="manifesto">
    <div class="shell">
      <p class="script-big">Ready to find your people?</p>
      <h2>LET'S CONNECT TOGETHER.</h2>
      <a class="btn btn-light" href="/join">Join the community <span class="arrow-circle">↗</span></a>
    </div>
  </section>
</main>
<%- include('partials/footer') %>
